    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39581" root="ندب" body-key="n">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اندبهُ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a wound) <i>made,</i> or <i>left, a scar
upon him.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He made a scar upon his
skin.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَبٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اندب بِظَهْرِهِ</span>, and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فى ظهره</span>, <i>He,</i> or <i>it, left scars</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُدُوب</span>) <i>upon his
back.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْدَبَتْهُ الحَاجَةُ إِنْدَابًا شَدِيدًا</span> (tropical:)  <i>The
thing,</i> or <i>want, made a severe impression upon
him.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اندب نَفْسَهُ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِنَفْسِهِ</span>, <i>He exposed
himself to peril.</i> (K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See 1.

